.TH ferry-tui 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-tui \- Interactive terminal user interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry tui\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Interactive terminal user interface
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
